WEBVTT

NOTE
The White SeeD Ship — the wooden, fan-winged vessel of the White SeeDs.
Duration: approximately 17 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.900
A long-decked wooden ship rides the sea at sunset.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.350
It spreads three enormous fan-shaped wings — the White SeeD Ship.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.600
It glides toward the glowing sun.
